</div></div></div><div id="cv" data-w-id="12f1cf6c-ea32-aeaa-92ba-814c5a0550f1" class="info-v-wrap-h s"><div class="info-v-wrap"><div id="features" class="container full rel"><div class="info-v-info-wrap"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-top"><div class="info-v-top"><div class="section-name"><div class="section-name-left set-2"><div class="bt-mono-2">Interceptor</div><div class="section-name-left_border"></div></div><div class="section-name-right">Zirka</div></div><div class="step-1-bot-bot s"><h2 data-text-fade-in="" class="h2">All Ukrainian interception experience in one system</h2></div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-wrap"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot set-1"><div class="btn-corner left-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner left-top"></div><div class="btn-corner right-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner right-top"></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item set-1"><div class="or">A.</div><div>Automatic target detection</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot-text set-1">An algorithm trained on thousands of real-world strikes by Shahed drones is capable of detecting targets at a distance of up to 1 km.</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot set-2"><div class="btn-corner left-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner left-top"></div><div class="btn-corner right-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner right-top"></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item"><div class="or">B.</div><div>Auto-guidance system</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot-text">The system’s machine vision increases interception effectiveness against highly maneuverable targets by up to 60%.</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot set-3"><div class="btn-corner left-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner left-top"></div><div class="btn-corner right-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner right-top"></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item"><div class="or">с.</div><div>Speed advantage</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot-text">Zirka’s air speed is twice the cruise speed of a Shahed drone (180 km/h).m/h).</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot set-4"><div class="btn-corner left-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner left-top"></div><div class="btn-corner right-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner right-top"></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item"><div class="or">d.</div><div>High vertival speed</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot-text">A climb rate of up to 40 m/s enables reaching 6,000 meters in just a few minutes.</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot set-5"><div class="btn-corner left-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner left-top"></div><div class="btn-corner right-bot"></div><div class="btn-corner right-top"></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item"><div class="or">e.</div><div>Additional positioning system</div></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-bot-text">An innovative communication system enables stable drone positioning in the air even in case of radar tracking loss.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="hero-video-1 w-embed"><video id="video4" muted playsinline style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover">
  <source src="assets/video/69f998fd504a7c84a1cd9307_6a141caec0836e85222fd720_SCROLL_2_MOBILE_mp4.mp4" type="video/mp4" media="(max-width: 767px)" />
  
</video></div><div class="gradient"></div><div class="canvas-wrapper"><canvas id="canvas" class="canvas"></canvas><div class="list-img-1 w-embed w-script"></div><div class="list-img-1 w-embed w-script"></div><div class="w-embed w-script"><!--



-->
<!--




-->

</div></div></div></div><div data-w-id="025f6602-b92e-6928-1111-427df91c2f5e" class="card-h"><div id="threat" class="card-st"><div class="container"><div class="card-wr"><div id="w-node-f0cf16f4-a5ed-0d63-f24f-9d3764a9cd82-7ece655a" class="card-wr-left"><div class="card-wr-left-left-border"></div><div class="card-wr-left-right-line"><div class="card-wr-left-right-line-active"></div><div class="card-wr-left-right-line-active-copy"></div></div><div class="card-wr-left-top"><div class="card-wr-left-top-num set-1">01</div><div class="card-wr-left-top-num set-2">02</div><div class="card-wr-left-top-num set-3">03</div><div class="card-wr-left-top-num set-4">04</div><div class="card-wr-left-top-num set-5">05</div></div><div class="card-wr-left-bot"><div class="card-wr-left-bot-top"><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece6563_icon_(2).svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-cr"/><div class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-wrap"><div class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item set-1"><h2 delay="0.4" data-text-fade-in="" class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-h">First strikes on Ukraine</h2><p class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-p">The use of Iranian UAV, Shahed-136, began with attacks on Ukraine in October 2022. These were massive kamikaze drones with pre-programmed flight paths that targeted civilian infrastructure.</p></div><div class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item set-2"><h2 class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-h">Geran-2: Russia’s adaptation of Shahed</h2><p class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-p">In recent years, Russia has scaled up mass production for drone upgrades. The warhead can now reach up to 90 kg, the flight range exceeds 1,000 km, and the system can be remotely controlled in real time, functioning similarly to a large FPV drone.</p></div><div class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item set-3"><h2 class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-h">From drone to terror platform</h2><p class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-p">Today, Shahed-type UAVs perform both strike and reconnaissance missions, engage dynamic targets, evade interceptors, and form airborne mesh networks. They are deployed in large-scale swarms, overwhelming air defense system.</p></div><div class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item set-4"><h2 class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-h">Mass attacks capable of disrupting a country</h2><p class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-p">A single large-scale strike can plunge a European country into blackout overnight. Within a week, it can disable critical infrastructure. Within a month, it can severely destabilize an entire state.</p></div><div class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item set-5"><h2 class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-h">Ukrainians are the only ones who can fight back</h2><p class="card-wr-left-bot-top-text-item-p">During the winter of 2025–2026 alone, Russia launched nearly 19,000 Shahed-type strike drones against Ukraine. The country held its ground, primarily due to the operational deployment of interceptor UAV units.</p></div></div></div><div class="card-wr-left-bot-bot"><div class="card-wr-left-bot-bot-num-wrap"><div scrub="" class="num-1">01</div><div class="num-2">02</div><div class="num-3">03</div><div class="num-4">04</div><div class="num-5">05</div></div><div class="card-wr-left-bot-bot-num">/05</div></div></div></div><div class="card-wr-right"><div class="card-wr-right-right-border"></div><div class="card-wr-right-item-wrapp"><div class="card-wr-right-item set-1"><div class="card-wr-right-item-text-wrap"><div class="card-wr-right-item-text"><div scrub="">//</div><div class="step-1-top-text-wrap"><div scrub="">Consequences of a Shahed-136 strike</div><div scrub="" class="text-padding">on a residential building</div><div scrub="" class="text-padding">in the city center</div><div scrub="" class="text-padding">Kyiv, Ukraine, 2022.</div><div scrub="">};</div></div></div></div><div class="card-wr-right-item-bg"><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece65a8_step-1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" alt="" class="card-wr-right-item-bg-img"/></div></div><div class="card-wr-right-item set-2"><div class="card-wr-right-item-text-wrap"><div class="card-wr-right-item-text"><div scrub="">//</div><div class="step-1-top-text-wrap"><div scrub="">Mass production of modified Iranian Shahed drones</div><div scrub="" class="text-padding">UAV &quot;Geran-2&quot;</div><div scrub="" class="text-padding">Yelabuga, Russia, 2025.</div><div scrub="">};</div></div></div></div><div class="card-wr-right-item-bg"><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece6597_step-2.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" alt="" class="card-wr-right-item-bg-img"/></div></div><div class="card-wr-right-item set-3"><div class="card-wr-right-item-text-wrap"><div class="card-wr-right-item-text"><div scrub="">//</div><div class="step-1-top-text-wrap"><div scrub="">Shahed carrying two FPV drones</div><div scrub="" class="text-padding">footage from an interceptor UAV</div><div scrub="" class="text-padding">2026.</div><div scrub="">};</div></div></div></div><div class="card-wr-right-item-bg"><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece659a_step-3.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" alt="" class="card-wr-right-item-bg-img"/></div></div><div class="card-wr-right-item set-4"><div class="card-wr-right-item-text-wrap"><div class="card-wr-right-item-text"><div scrub="">//</div><div class="step-1-top-text-wrap"><div scrub="">Consequences of mass attacks</div><div scrub="" class="text-padding">by Russian drones</div><div scrub="" class="text-padding">on the Darnytsia TPP.</div><div scrub="" class="text-padding">Kyiv, Ukraine, 2026.</div><div scrub="">};</div></div></div></div><div class="card-wr-right-item-bg"><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece6595_step-4.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" alt="" class="card-wr-right-item-bg-img"/></div></div><div class="card-wr-right-item set-5"><div class="card-wr-right-item-text-wrap"><div class="card-wr-right-item-text"><div scrub="">//</div><div class="step-1-top-text-wrap"><div scrub="">Darknode battalion pilot</div><div scrub="" class="text-padding">operates an interceptor drone.</div><div scrub="" class="text-padding">Spring, 2026.</div><div scrub="">};</div></div></div></div><div class="card-wr-right-item-bg"><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece6591_step-5.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" alt="" class="card-wr-right-item-bg-img"/></div></div></div><div class="date-time-wrap"><div class="date-time-left"><div>©</div><div class="flex-0-56"><div class="date">15 04 2026</div><div class="time0wrap"><div class="time-w">17 35</div><div class="time-utc">UTC +3</div></div></div></div><div class="date-time-right"><div scrub="">ZIRKA INTERCEPTOR</div></div></div></div><div class="card-wr-left-left-border mob-h"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="stat-wrap"><div class="stat-section"><div class="container is_step-1 set_2"><div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat-grid-left"><div class="stat-grid-left-top"><div class="info-v-top"><div class="step-1-bot-bot"><h2 data-text-fade-in="" class="h2">Fight efficiently: destroy drones using drones</h2></div></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top hide-lap">Modern warfare is driven by mass low-cost UAVs that exhaust resources and penetrate defenses. Zirka lets you work faster and more cost-effectively.</div><div class="stat-tag">Target cost: $50,000</div></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top">Modern warfare is driven by mass low-cost UAVs that exhaust resources and penetrate defenses. Zirka lets you work faster and more cost-effectively.</div><div data-w-id="ad1e2057-4a9a-1d0d-b6fe-670ee747f8c9" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item"><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h">Zirka</div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top">/ drone interceptor</div></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item"><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h">$2.5K</div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top">/ per unit</div></div></div><div data-w-id="ba2768ea-94cf-cca6-ccd0-77dec57feb97" class="progress-1"><div style="width:0%" class="progress-fill-1"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="stat-grid-right"><div class="stat-grid-right-top"><div class="stat-grid-right-top-item"><div class="greu-cube"></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top">Target destruction usually costs more than a single shot.</div></div><div class="stat-grid-right-top-item"><div class="greu-cube"></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top">According to most military doctrines, two or more munitions are usually required to ensure a guaranteed hit on a single target.</div></div></div><div class="stat-grid-right-bot"><div data-w-id="8c8c2e63-e500-0539-f61f-2b79b0d389c9" class="stat-grid-right-bot-item"><div class="stat-grid-right-bot-item-top"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item"><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s">APKWS Hydra 70</div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top s">/ Air-to-air missile</div></div><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s">$40K</div></div><div class="progress-2"><div style="width:0%" class="progress-fill-2 set-1"></div></div></div><div data-w-id="515551d2-ef1c-1ebf-9bb4-23faadb23696" class="stat-grid-right-bot-item"><div class="stat-grid-right-bot-item-top"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item"><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s">Rheinmetall mini-AAM</div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top s">/ Air-to-air missile</div></div><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s">$100K</div></div><div class="progress-2"><div style="width:0%" class="progress-fill-2 set-2"></div></div></div><div data-w-id="45e23197-880d-e2af-e319-4ec714523be5" class="stat-grid-right-bot-item"><div class="stat-grid-right-bot-item-top"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item"><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s">FIM-92 STINGER</div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top s">/ MANPADS missile</div></div><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s">$250K</div></div><div class="progress-2"><div style="width:0%" class="progress-fill-2 set-3"></div></div></div><div data-w-id="a4412a86-9642-9f6f-ff2a-7b293ed84068" class="stat-grid-right-bot-item"><div class="stat-grid-right-bot-item-top"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item"><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s">IRIS-T SLS</div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top s">/ IRIS-T air-defense missile</div></div><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s">$500K</div></div><div class="progress-2"><div style="width:0%" class="progress-fill-2 set-4"></div></div></div><div data-w-id="586d6f7d-6e4b-97e2-020a-580d2387b184" class="stat-grid-right-bot-item"><div class="stat-grid-right-bot-item-top"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item"><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s">AIM-120 AMRAAM</div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top s">/ NASAMS air-defense missile</div></div><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s">$1M+</div></div><div class="progress-2"><div style="width:0%" class="progress-fill-2 set-5"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot show-mob"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item s"><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h">Zirka</div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top">/ drone interceptor</div></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item s"><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h">$2.5K</div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top">/ per unit</div></div></div><div data-w-id="0d82e09f-3690-361b-d846-11d76a2ed7b6" class="progress-1"><div style="width:0%" class="progress-fill-1"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="container is_step-1 set_2 option-2"><div class="stat-grid _2"><div class="stat-grid-left _100"><div class="stat-grid-left-top _50vh"><div class="info-v-top"><div class="step-1-bot-bot set-3"><h2 data-text-fade-in="" class="h2">Fight efficiently: destroy drones using drones</h2></div></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top hide-lap">Modern warfare is driven by mass low-cost UAVs that exhaust resources and penetrate defenses. Zirka lets you work faster and more cost-effectively.</div><div class="stat-discription tag">Successful mission to intercept a shahed</div></div><div class="stat-grid-right-bot alt"><div data-w-id="f1191a33-d649-d673-d3ee-3d10eb93058c" class="stat-grid-right-bot-item alt"><div class="stat-grid-right-bot-item-top"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item"><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s orange">Interceptor Zirka</div></div><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s orange">$5K</div></div><div class="progress-2"><div style="width:0%" class="progress-fill-2 set-1"></div></div></div><div data-w-id="f1191a33-d649-d673-d3ee-3d10eb930597" class="stat-grid-right-bot-item"><div class="stat-grid-right-bot-item-top"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item"><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s">MANPAD</div></div><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s">$100K</div></div><div class="progress-2"><div style="width:0%" class="progress-fill-2 set-2"></div></div></div><div data-w-id="f1191a33-d649-d673-d3ee-3d10eb9305ad" class="stat-grid-right-bot-item"><div class="stat-grid-right-bot-item-top"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item"><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s">Aviation</div></div><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s">$500K</div></div><div class="progress-2"><div style="width:0%" class="progress-fill-2 set-4"></div></div></div><div data-w-id="f1191a33-d649-d673-d3ee-3d10eb9305b8" class="stat-grid-right-bot-item"><div class="stat-grid-right-bot-item-top"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item"><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s">Missile Systems</div></div><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s">$1M+</div></div><div class="progress-2"><div style="width:0%" class="progress-fill-2 set-5"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="stat-grid-right"><div class="stat-grid-right-top alt-opt"><div class="stat-grid-right-top-item"><div class="greu-cube"></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top">Modern warfare is driven by mass low-cost UAVs that exhaust resources and penetrate defenses. Zirka lets you work faster and more cost-effectively.</div></div><div class="stat-grid-right-top-item"><div class="greu-cube"></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top">According to most military doctrines, two or more munitions are usually required to ensure a guaranteed hit on a single target.</div></div></div><div class="stat-lines-container"><div class="div-block-4"><img src="assets/img/6a96dcc0d9186b2d782a5a7e_Frame_427320791.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 689px) 100vw, 689px" alt="" id="move" class="image-7"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68a3_Group_2117129759.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" alt="" class="image-7 mob"/><img src="assets/img/6a983aadffb5396ed81b8443_Frame_427320794_(1).png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-11"/></div><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68c6_line-bot.svg" loading="lazy" width="Auto" alt="" class="line-bot"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68c5_Vector_(5).svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="line-top"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68c7_line-left.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="line-left"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68c8_line-right.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="line-right"/></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top"><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item alt"><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s b">Target cost</div><div data-text-fade-in="" class="stat-grid-left-bot-bot-top-item-h-s b">$50K</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot show-mob"></div></div><div class="hide w-embed w-script"></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id="62dad607-cc0d-e5a1-c1ed-72ea7b5b58c4" class="new-sec"><div class="new-sec-st"><div class="container _w-100"><div class="new-sec-heading"><div class="section-name"><div class="section-name-left set-4"><div class="bt-mono-2">PROVEN</div><div class="section-name-left_border"></div></div><div class="section-name-right">IN COMBAT</div></div><div class="rel-h-wrap"><h2 data-text-fade-in="" class="h1 set-2 set-3">The specification for</h2><h2 data-text-fade-in="" class="h1 set-2 set-3"> this system was </h2><h2 data-text-fade-in="" class="h1 set-2 set-3">written by the </h2><h2 data-text-fade-in="" class="h1 set-2 set-3">threat itself</h2><div class="text-cent-new"><div scrub="" class="bt-mono-1 white">DEFENSE</div><div scrub="" class="bt-mono-1 white">INTERCEPTION</div></div></div></div><div class="img-new-wrapper"><div class="img-new-wrap"><img src="assets/img/6a96cc79ac3b024e22eebce8_proven_in_combat_(2)_(1).png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 2880px) 100vw, 2880px" alt="" class="img-cover"/></div></div><div class="bot-new-wrap"><div class="progress-new"><div class="progress-new-active"></div></div></div><img src="assets/img/6a73212ba58bbb252ac2594c_Frame_427320578_(1).svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="scroll-img"/><div class="abs-new-wrap"><div class="abs-new-wrap-top"><img src="assets/img/6a73288363aa42d5d662a6fe_Union.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="abs-new-wrap-top-img"/><h2 class="abs-new-wrap-top-heading">None of these numbers are ours. They are the conditions that Zirka had to be designed against, every night.</h2></div><div class="abs-new-wrap-center"><div class="bt-mono-1 white op-4 max-w-13">THE LARGEST ATTACK RECORDED TO DATE USED THE EQUIVALENT OF UNDER THREE DAYS OF PRODUCTION AT THAT MONTHLY RATE.</div><div class="bt-mono-1 white op-4 max-w-13">ZIRKA WAS SPECIFIED AGAINST THE RATE OF PRODUCTION, NOT AGAINST THE RECORD. THE RATE IS WHAT REPEATS.</div><div class="top-line-new-sec"></div></div><div class="abs-new-wrap-bot"><div class="abs-new-wrap-bot-item"><div class="bt-mono-1 white">SHAHEDS LAUNCHED IN ONE DAY</div><div class="abs-new-wrap-bot-item-num">948</div><div class="abs-new-wrap-bot-item-line"></div></div><div class="abs-new-wrap-bot-item"><div class="bt-mono-1 white">SHAHEDS BUILT IN ONE MONTH</div><div class="abs-new-wrap-bot-item-num">12K</div><div class="abs-new-wrap-bot-item-line"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="anim-logic w-embed w-script"></div></div><div data-w-id="19e3b51b-f15c-261a-8880-728ccd5dc168" class="hover-area-wrapper"><div class="hover-area"><div class="container rel set"><div class="hover-area-wrap"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-top set-2"><div class="info-v-top"><div class="step-1-bot-bot set"><h2 class="h2">The interceptor is part of a system</h2></div></div><div class="info-v-info-wrap-top-right hide"><div class="section-name hide-mob"><div class="section-name-left set-2"><div class="bt-mono-2">Interceptor</div><div class="section-name-left_border"></div></div><div class="section-name-right">system</div></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top set-2">The interceptor is the core of the system, but eliminating threats is impossible without other components that enhance its precision, speed, and effectiveness.</div></div></div><div class="hover-area-wrap-bot"><div id="w-node-_76c395a2-a95e-7640-d432-7bbd663a7b76-7ece655a" class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item set-1"><div class="hover-icon-wrap"><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68c9_icon-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item-icon"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68ca_icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item-icon hover"/></div><div class="flex-1-11"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item-s"><div class="or">A.</div><div>Interception System</div></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top">The interceptor is the core of the system, but eliminating threats is impossible without other components that enhance its precision, speed, and effectiveness.</div></div><div class="system-progress"><div class="system-progress-line"></div></div></div><div id="w-node-bdc19020-882a-4b18-6419-6e6a86ad85d8-7ece655a" class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item set-2"><div class="hover-icon-wrap"><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece6565_icon-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item-icon"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece6570_icon-1.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item-icon hover"/></div><div class="flex-1-11"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item-s"><div class="or">b.</div><div>Detection sensors</div></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top">A network of acoustic, optical, and radio-frequency sensors for detecting and confirming the type of enemy targets.</div></div><div class="system-progress"><div class="system-progress-line"></div></div></div><div class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item set-3"><div class="hover-icon-wrap"><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece6564_icon-2.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item-icon"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece656e_icon-4.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item-icon hover"/></div><div class="flex-1-11"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item-s"><div class="or">c.</div><div>Radar system</div></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top">The &quot;eyes&quot; of the system, providing target detection within a defined sector with enhanced precision.</div></div><div class="system-progress"><div class="system-progress-line"></div></div></div><div class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item set-4"><div class="hover-icon-wrap"><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece6566_icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item-icon"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece656f_icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item-icon hover"/></div><div class="flex-1-11"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item-s"><div class="or">d.</div><div>Automatic target detection</div></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top">Software that identifies threats and ensures situational awareness, coordination, and battle management.</div></div><div class="system-progress"><div class="system-progress-line"></div></div></div><div class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item set-5"><div class="hover-icon-wrap"><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece6576_icon-3.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item-icon"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece657b_icon-2.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item-icon hover"/></div><div class="flex-1-11"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item-s"><div class="or">e.</div><div>Command center</div></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top">People who identify threats and manage the dynamics of combat in real time.</div></div><div class="system-progress"><div class="system-progress-line"></div></div></div><div class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item set-6"><div class="hover-icon-wrap"><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece657f_icon-4.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item-icon"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece656d_icon-3.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="hover-area-wrap-bot-item-icon hover"/></div><div class="flex-1-11"><div class="info-v-info-wrap-bot-top-item-s"><div class="or">f.</div><div>Trained crew</div></div><div class="stat-grid-left-bot-text-top">Training combat crews from scratch — not only flight skills, but also tactical application, SOF support, and escort during real intercepts.</div></div><div class="system-progress"><div class="system-progress-line"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="hover-area-img-wrap"><div class="hover-area-img-wrap-l"><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68dc_system-1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 2880px) 100vw, 2880px" alt="" class="image-h-1"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68d9_system-3.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 2880px) 100vw, 2880px" alt="" class="image-h-2"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68d8_system-2.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 2880px) 100vw, 2880px" alt="" class="image-h-3"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68da_system-4.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 2880px) 100vw, 2880px" alt="" class="image-h-4"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68db_system-5.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 2880px) 100vw, 2880px" alt="" class="image-h-5"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68cf_system-6.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 2880px) 100vw, 2880px" alt="" class="image-h-6"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68d2_ZIRKA_5.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-h-1 mob"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68d1_ANTENNA_1.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-h-2 mob"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68d3_RLS_1.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-h-3 mob"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68d5_CODE_1.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-h-4 mob"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68d6_COMMAND_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" alt="" class="image-h-5 mob"/><img src="assets/img/6a6b45050da8002d7ece68d4_PILOT_1.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-h-6 mob"/></div></div><div id="system" class="pos"></div></div></div><div data-w-id="cd71f4d6-20f8-35f8-1393-b9c232d531e6" class="ppo-wrap"><div class="ppo"><div class="bg-story w-embed"><video id="video-story" muted playsinline style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover">
  <source src="assets/video/zirka_video_horizontal-2.mp4" type="video/mp4" media="(min-width: 768px)"/>
  <source src="assets/video/zirka_video_mobile_1.mp4" type="video/mp4" media="(max-width: 767px)"/>

</video></div><div class="ppo-video-logic w-embed w-script"><!--

