</div><div class="full-block"><div class="full-block-item-2"><h2 class="h1 set-2">Building the next generation of air defense</h2><img src="assets/img/6a20250422298d77584fc9d2_icon_(3).svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ppo-icon-2"/><p class="bt-mono-1 white set-ppo">We’re evolving Zirka into a fully autonomous anti-aircraft drone system. The target project is planned to be completed by the end of 2026.</p></div><div class="ppo-text-item-wrap-2"><div class="ppo-text-item"><img src="assets/img/6a70941f6ecb7a47b5b79f57_ppo-txt.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ppo-text"/><img src="assets/img/6a70941f6ecb7a47b5b79f57_ppo-txt.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ppo-text"/><img src="assets/img/6a70941f6ecb7a47b5b79f57_ppo-txt.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ppo-text"/><img src="assets/img/6a70941f6ecb7a47b5b79f57_ppo-txt.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ppo-text"/></div><div class="ppo-text-item"><img src="assets/img/6a70941f6ecb7a47b5b79f57_ppo-txt.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ppo-text"/><img src="assets/img/6a70941f6ecb7a47b5b79f57_ppo-txt.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ppo-text"/><img src="assets/img/6a70941f6ecb7a47b5b79f57_ppo-txt.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ppo-text"/><img src="assets/img/6a70941f6ecb7a47b5b79f57_ppo-txt.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ppo-text"/></div><div class="ppo-text-item"><img src="assets/img/6a70941f6ecb7a47b5b79f57_ppo-txt.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ppo-text"/><img src="assets/img/6a70941f6ecb7a47b5b79f57_ppo-txt.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ppo-text"/><img src="assets/img/6a70941f6ecb7a47b5b79f57_ppo-txt.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ppo-text"/><img src="assets/img/6a70941f6ecb7a47b5b79f57_ppo-txt.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ppo-text"/></div><div class="ppo-text-item"><img src="assets/img/6a70941f6ecb7a47b5b79f57_ppo-txt.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ppo-text"/><img src="assets/img/6a70941f6ecb7a47b5b79f57_ppo-txt.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="ppo-text"/><img src="assets/img/6a70941f6ecb7a47b5